WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:04.711
Andy gulped. "Uh-oh.

2
00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:09.339
Rock Canyon has strong currents!"

3
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.075
"Don't worry," Cora said.

4
00:00:12.076 --> 00:00:15.246
"I'll find the young angelfish."

5
00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:21.395
Octo wiggled his arms. "Let's go!"

6
00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:25.692
"No. You stay here, Octo," Cora said.

7
00:00:25.693 --> 00:00:30.042
"But I want to come!" Octo said.

8
00:00:30.043 --> 00:00:33.402
"Sorry," Cora said.

9
00:00:33.403 --> 00:00:36.254
"The angelfish might come back.

10
00:00:36.255 --> 00:00:38.915
Please wait here with Andy."

11
00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:56.498
"Okay." Octo sighed. "Can we play tag, Andy?"

12
00:00:56.499 --> 00:01:03.329
Cora and Mo swam fast to the compass.

13
00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:08.497
Inside was a picture of the missing angelfish.

14
00:01:08.498 --> 00:01:12.281
"They're stuck behind a big rock," Cora said.

15
00:01:12.282 --> 00:01:16.960
"We need to rescue them!"

16
00:01:16.961 --> 00:01:22.002
Cora and Mo followed the red arrow.

17
00:01:22.003 --> 00:01:27.447
They swam through a deep canyon.

18
00:01:27.448 --> 00:01:31.637
The current grew stronger.

19
00:01:31.638 --> 00:01:34.780
Rocks tumbled around.

20
00:01:34.781 --> 00:01:39.455
"It's hard to keep swimming!" Mo cried.

21
00:01:39.456 --> 00:01:45.578
"Here, grab my tentacle!" Cora said.

22
00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:50.310
The arrow finally stopped.

23
00:01:50.311 --> 00:01:55.051
It pointed at a huge rock.

24
00:01:55.052 --> 00:01:58.356
"Help! Help!"

25
00:01:58.357 --> 00:02:04.444
Cora heard tiny voices.

26
00:02:04.445 --> 00:02:07.153
She peeked behind the rock.

27
00:02:07.154 --> 00:02:10.933
It was the young angelfish!

28
00:02:10.934 --> 00:02:14.755
"Please help!" one angelfish said.

29
00:02:14.756 --> 00:02:18.373
"This rock trapped us!" the other said.

30
00:02:18.374 --> 00:02:21.297
"Don't worry," Cora said.

31
00:02:21.298 --> 00:02:23.939
"We'll get you out."

